</style></head><body><?php $showMeter = true; require dirname(__DIR__, 2) . '/includes/site-header.php'; ?><main class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Bum Bum's toolbox</p><img class="tool-mascot-page" src="/bum/cat-work.png" alt="Bum Bum in work mode"><h1>Talk it out. We'll write it down.</h1><p class="lede">Hit record and talk it out. Your words appear as you speak, and when you stop your transcript is saved to your private library, ready to copy or download. The audio never leaves your browser. One finished note uses one action.</p>
